## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design a CAPA for data-quality failures in a multi-region streaming system, focusing on traceable evidence, lifecycle consistency, and measurable containment.

## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model design with domain-appropriate fields
- Lifecycle state machine for incident progression
- Minimal REST API contract for creating/updating CAPAs with evidence
- Region-aware metrics to prove containment and prevent recurrence
- RCA templates and canary-based remediation strategies

## Code Example

